# MARS ROVER SENSOR FUSION

### (Arduino Mega – VS Code / PlatformIO Project)

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is an **Arduino Mega 2560 based embedded system** that integrates:

* 🛠 Drill motor control (Up/Down + Rotation)
* ⚙ Linear actuator control
* 🚪 Servo-controlled gate
* 🌡 Environmental monitoring system
* 📡 Serial command interface
* 📦 JSON-based sensor data response

The system allows **command-based mechanical control** and **on-demand environmental data retrieval**.

---

# 🏗 Project Structure (PlatformIO)

```
project-root/
│
├── include/
│   └── motor_drive.h
│
├── src/
│   ├── main.cpp
│   ├── motor_drive.cpp
│   ├── temperaturesensor.cpp
│   ├── anemometer.cpp
│   ├── soilsensor.cpp
│   ├── dustsensor.cpp
│   ├── dht11.cpp
│   └── pressure_sensor.cpp
│
├── platformio.ini
└── README.md
```

---

# ⚙ PlatformIO Configuration

## Example `platformio.ini`

```ini
[env:megaatmega2560]
platform = atmelavr
board = megaatmega2560
framework = arduino
monitor_speed = 9600
```

---

# 🔌 Pin Configuration

| Function         | Pin |
| ---------------- | --- |
| Drill Up         | 5   |
| Drill Down       | 6   |
| Drill Clockwise  | 7   |
| Drill Anti       | 25  |
| Actuator Up      | 8   |
| Actuator Down    | 9   |
| Funel Right      | 10  |
| Funel Left       | 11  |
| Servo Gate       | 4   |
| Gas Sensor (ADC) | A8  |

---

# 📡 Serial Commands

Use **PlatformIO Serial Monitor**:

```
PlatformIO → Monitor
```

or run:

```
pio device monitor
```

Baud rate: **9600**

---

## 🔧 Drill Commands

```
DRILL_UP
DRILL_DOWN
DRILL_UP_DOWN_STOP
DRILL_CLOCK
DRILL_ANTI
DRILL_ROTATION_STOP
```

---

## ⚙ Actuator Commands

```
ACTUATOR_UP
ACTUATOR_DOWN
ACTUATOR_STOP
```

---

## 🚪 Gate Commands

```
GATE_OPEN
GATE_CLOSE
```

---
## 🚪 FUNEL Commands

```
FUNEL_RIGHT
FUNEL_LEFT
FUNEL_STOP
```

---

## 📊 Request Sensor Data

```
SENSOR_DATA_REQUEST
```

