---

# 🚀 How to Build & Upload (VS Code)

### 1️⃣ Build Project

```
pio run
```

### 2️⃣ Upload to Board

```
pio run --target upload
```

### 3️⃣ Open Serial Monitor

```
pio device monitor
```

---

# 🧠 System Features

✔ Modular architecture
✔ Struct-based sensor data management
✔ Command-driven motor control
✔ JSON formatted response
✔ Expandable sensor support
✔ Servo-based gate mechanism

---

# ⚠ Important Notes

* Use stable 5V power for motors and servo.
* Gas sensors require warm-up time.
* Avoid rapid command spamming.
* Servo initializes in closed position.
* Motors default to OFF state at startup.

